      "created_at": "2019-04-25T18:09:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I usually play multiplayer on Tabletop Simulator. &nbsp;That’s not to say we don’t have a soundtrack. &nbsp;The following songs have come up at least once this month:</p>\n<p>Big Enough (the part with the screaming sky cowboy)</p>\n<p>Yakety Sax</p>\n<p>Yee (not the official version, but my live rendition)</p>\n<p>That’s all I can think of, but you get the idea. &nbsp;Memes and weirdness.</p>",
