      "created_at": "2019-04-27T09:17:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Let's see here, coming from Paper Mario..</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Normal Gloomy - Shadow Queen Phase 1</p>\n<p>Skinwalker Gloomy - Shadow Queen Phase 2</p>\n<p>The Ennead - Huffen N' Puffin</p>\n<p>Progeny - Smorg theme</p>\n<p>Normal Omni - Magnus Von Grapple</p>\n<p>Comic Omni - Boss Grodus</p>\n<p>Kargraa - Rawk Hawk</p>\n<p>The Chairman - Macho Grubba</p>\n<p>La Capitan - Cortez</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>From Touhou..</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>The Dreamer - Last Occultism (ULiL eidtion)</p>\n<p>Deadline - Nuclear Fusion (SA version)</p>\n<p>Normal Spite - Heian Alien</p>\n<p>Gloom Spite - U.N. Owen was Her?</p>",
